   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2022-03-30",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The bill halves the excise rate on domestically produced petrol and diesel from 44.2 to 22.1 cents per litre for six months from 30 March to 28 September 2022, citing the Russian invasion of Ukraine and cost-of-living pressures, with the ACCC monitoring to ensure benefits are passed on."
  }
